WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.310
Check the bundle before you send anything.

2
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.872
Run the upload command with the dry-run flag.

3
00:00:06.922 --> 00:00:12.852
It validates the bundle with the same validator the real upload uses, then stops.

4
00:00:12.902 --> 00:00:16.800
Nothing leaves your machine, and no key is needed.

